  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 4.912,
      "text": "What does it take to engineer an AI\ncustomer support platform that serves"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.932,
      "end": 6.283,
      "text": "multiple businesses,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.523,
      "end": 8.002,
      "text": "while keeping their knowledge,"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.242,
      "end": 9.324,
      "text": "conversations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.475,
      "end": 13.299,
      "text": "and customer data isolated?"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.705,
      "end": 18.586,
      "text": "This case study shows the product, the\narchitecture, what broke,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.606,
      "end": 19.745,
      "text": "and what is unproven."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.683,
      "end": 24.288,
      "text": "Customers ask the same questions again and\nagain."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.308,
      "end": 29.301,
      "text": "The answers usually exist, spread across\npolicy documents and web pages,"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.321,
      "end": 31.302,
      "text": "but someone has to find them each time."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.542,
      "end": 35.604,
      "text": "A support assistant grounded in a\nbusiness's own material can help."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.947,
      "end": 40.695,
      "text": "And if one shared platform serves many\nseparate businesses,"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.715,
      "end": 44.256,
      "text": "every answer has to come from the right\none, and only that one."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.583,
      "end": 50.687,
      "text": "Here is the real application, running\nlocally with fictional data."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.707,
      "end": 52.075,
      "text": "An owner signs in,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.315,
      "end": 54.691,
      "text": "and lands on the organization dashboard."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.931,
      "end": 58.859,
      "text": "A short wizard creates a chatbot, with its\nbehaviour and appearance."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.833,
      "end": 65.427,
      "text": "Documents are uploaded, and a background\nworker takes each one from queued,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.447,
      "end": 67.015,
      "text": "to processing, to ready."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.255,
      "end": 69.483,
      "text": "You can inspect the passages it produced,"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.722,
      "end": 72.153,
      "text": "and test which ones a question retrieves."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.833,
      "end": 74.823,
      "text": "Websites can be added too."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.843,
      "end": 78.15,
      "text": "Here, the crawler refuses a private\nnetwork address."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.083,
      "end": 83.078,
      "text": "In the playground, a question streams back\nwith a numbered source."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.098,
      "end": 84.616,
      "text": "One important note:"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.636,
      "end": 87.516,
      "text": "this is a deterministic demonstration."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.536,
      "end": 91.441,
      "text": "The reply is a fixed sentence, not an AI\nanswer."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.461,
      "end": 95.238,
      "text": "What is real is the retrieval, the\nstreaming and the citation."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.478,
      "end": 98.465,
      "text": "An unrelated question gets a fallback\ninstead."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.617,
      "end": 103.277,
      "text": "Once the bot is active, the website's\norigin is verified."
    },
    {
      "start": 103.517,
      "end": 107.721,
      "text": "A visitor asks through the embedded\nwidget, and the conversation is stored."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.818,
      "end": 112.87,
      "text": "The team sees it in the inbox and marks it\nresolved."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.614,
      "end": 117.175,
      "text": "Analytics update from stored events."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.195,
      "end": 120.061,
      "text": "These figures are synthetic demonstration\ndata."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.383,
      "end": 124.747,
      "text": "The system is a modular monolith:"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.767,
      "end": 129.784,
      "text": "one Python codebase and one database, run\nas several processes."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.804,
      "end": 131.479,
      "text": "Think of it in four layers."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.719,
      "end": 133.67,
      "text": "First, experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.69,
      "end": 138.208,
      "text": "A dashboard built with Next.js, React and\nTypeScript,"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.228,
      "end": 142.102,
      "text": "and a small widget that opens an isolated\nframe on a customer's site."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.05,
      "end": 145.093,
      "text": "Second, the application."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.113,
      "end": 148.468,
      "text": "FastAPI handles ordinary requests."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.488,
      "end": 152.806,
      "text": "Dashboard requests are authenticated and\nchecked against the member's role,"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.826,
      "end": 155.87,
      "text": "and chat answers stream back as server-\nsent events."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.817,
      "end": 159.247,
      "text": "Third, data and processing."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.267,
      "end": 164.497,
      "text": "PostgreSQL holds relational data, and\nvectors with pgvector."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.517,
      "end": 168.059,
      "text": "Private object storage keeps the original\nfiles."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.079,
      "end": 170.772,
      "text": "Redis carries the queue to Celery workers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.792,
      "end": 174.997,
      "text": "and Celery Beat schedules a recovery sweep\nfor a separate maintenance worker."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.95,
      "end": 177.692,
      "text": "Fourth, intelligence:"
    },
    {
      "start": 177.712,
      "end": 181.379,
      "text": "document processing, retrieval and prompt\nconstruction,"
    },
    {
      "start": 181.399,
      "end": 184.654,
      "text": "with adapters for language and embedding\nmodels."
    },
    {
      "start": 184.674,
      "end": 189.065,
      "text": "This is code inside those same processes,\nnot separate services."
    },
    {
      "start": 190.017,
      "end": 190.756,
      "text": "Together:"
    },
    {
      "start": 190.776,
      "end": 195.843,
      "text": "synchronous requests, streamed answers,\nand background jobs, in Docker containers."
    },
    {
      "start": 196.083,
      "end": 199.575,
      "text": "Several containers do not make this\nmicroservices."
    },
    {
      "start": 199.595,
      "end": 202.439,
      "text": "This detailed diagram shows each\nconnection."
    },
    {
      "start": 204.783,
      "end": 209.851,
      "text": "Retrieval augmented generation, or RAG,\nmeans finding evidence first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 209.871,
      "end": 211.451,
      "text": "then writing from it."
    },
    {
      "start": 211.471,
      "end": 215.015,
      "text": "A file or web page is extracted into text\nand cleaned."
    },
    {
      "start": 215.255,
      "end": 219.153,
      "text": "It is split into overlapping chunks that\nnever cross a heading."
    },
    {
      "start": 219.173,
      "end": 223.641,
      "text": "Each chunk gets an embedding, a list of\nnumbers, stored beside the text."
    },
    {
      "start": 224.583,
      "end": 226.926,
      "text": "A question is searched two ways."
    },
    {
      "start": 226.946,
      "end": 231.026,
      "text": "Vector search compares embeddings, keyword\nsearch matches words,"
    },
    {
      "start": 231.046,
      "end": 233.238,
      "text": "and the two rankings are merged."
    },
    {
      "start": 233.258,
      "end": 237.537,
      "text": "Retrieval is always scoped to one\norganization and one chatbot."
    },
    {
      "start": 238.375,
      "end": 241.251,
      "text": "The prompt is assembled, the model\nstreams,"
    },
    {
      "start": 241.271,
      "end": 244.289,
      "text": "and citations are validated on the way\nout."
    },
    {
      "start": 244.309,
      "end": 247.611,
      "text": "Only sources that actually entered the\nprompt can be cited."
    },
    {
      "start": 248.55,
      "end": 253.049,
      "text": "Citation provenance establishes which\nsources were shown to the model."
    },
    {
      "start": 253.069,
      "end": 255.96,
      "text": "It does not show that a source supports\nthe sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 256.2,
      "end": 260.344,
      "text": "Offline answer-bearing recall at five is\neighty-five percent,"
    },
    {
      "start": 260.364,
      "end": 263.969,
      "text": "measured with stand-in embeddings that\nonly match words."
    },
    {
      "start": 263.989,
      "end": 266.219,
      "text": "The target is ninety percent."
    },
    {
      "start": 266.239,
      "end": 268.691,
      "text": "Real model accuracy is untested."
    },
    {
      "start": 271.017,
      "end": 274.666,
      "text": "Take two fictional businesses, each with\nits own chatbot,"
    },
    {
      "start": 274.686,
      "end": 276.465,
      "text": "documents and conversations."
    },
    {
      "start": 276.705,
      "end": 279.865,
      "text": "Here the second owner opens the first\none's address,"
    },
    {
      "start": 279.885,
      "end": 281.925,
      "text": "and gets organization not found."
    },
    {
      "start": 282.85,
      "end": 285.048,
      "text": "Several layers enforce this."
    },
    {
      "start": 285.068,
      "end": 287.411,
      "text": "Sessions are managed on the server."
    },
    {
      "start": 287.431,
      "end": 293.548,
      "text": "The browser holds only an opaque session\nidentifier, in an HttpOnly cookie."
    },
    {
      "start": 293.568,
      "end": 296.248,
      "text": "Roles decide what each member may do."
    },
    {
      "start": 296.268,
      "end": 298.698,
      "text": "Queries are scoped to the organization,"
    },
    {
      "start": 298.718,
      "end": 303.361,
      "text": "and PostgreSQL enforces forced row-level\nsecurity underneath,"
    },
    {
      "start": 303.381,
      "end": 305.985,
      "text": "so a missed filter is not enough to leak a\nrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 306.917,
      "end": 311.503,
      "text": "Public widgets receive short-lived tokens\nlimited to one conversation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 311.523,
      "end": 314.478,
      "text": "and visitors get only the fields they\nneed."
    },
    {
      "start": 314.498,
      "end": 317.816,
      "text": "Forwarding headers are trusted only from\nlisted proxies,"
    },
    {
      "start": 317.836,
      "end": 321.176,
      "text": "and AI providers must use HTTPS."
    },
    {
      "start": 321.416,
      "end": 325.248,
      "text": "This is tested design, not a security\ncertification,"
    },
    {
      "start": 325.268,
      "end": 327.348,
      "text": "and not every attack has been tried."
    },
    {
      "start": 329.683,
      "end": 334.32,
      "text": "An audit then found problems that the\nexisting, passing tests had missed."
    },
    {
      "start": 334.34,
      "end": 338.333,
      "text": "Here are eleven, some from the audit and\nsome found while fixing it."
    },
    {
      "start": 339.533,
      "end": 340.119,
      "text": "First."
    },
    {
      "start": 340.139,
      "end": 342.335,
      "text": "Ten simultaneous chats all failed."
    },
    {
      "start": 342.575,
      "end": 346.689,
      "text": "Each request held one database connection\nwhile asking for another."
    },
    {
      "start": 346.929,
      "end": 350.589,
      "text": "The fix releases it early, keeps\ntransactions short,"
    },
    {
      "start": 350.609,
      "end": 354.127,
      "text": "admits only bounded work, and makes\ncleanup safe to repeat."
    },
    {
      "start": 354.367,
      "end": 358.296,
      "text": "At one hundred concurrent requests, sixty-\nseven succeeded,"
    },
    {
      "start": 358.316,
      "end": 361.059,
      "text": "thirty-three received a controlled\nrejection,"
    },
    {
      "start": 361.079,
      "end": 363.528,
      "text": "and there were zero unexpected failures."
    },
    {
      "start": 363.768,
      "end": 366.591,
      "text": "That used an offline provider on one\nlaptop."
    },
    {
      "start": 367.567,
      "end": 368.196,
      "text": "Second."
    },
    {
      "start": 368.216,
      "end": 370.651,
      "text": "A source cut from the prompt could still\nbe cited."
    },
    {
      "start": 370.891,
      "end": 374.754,
      "text": "Citations were checked against what was\nselected, not what was shown."
    },
    {
      "start": 374.994,
      "end": 378.971,
      "text": "Now one renderer records exactly which\nsources the model saw,"
    },
    {
      "start": 378.991,
      "end": 380.158,
      "text": "even while streaming."
    },
    {
      "start": 380.398,
      "end": 384.121,
      "text": "The original failing test passes, with\nthirty-two new tests."
    },
    {
      "start": 384.361,
      "end": 387.732,
      "text": "Whether a source supports a sentence is\nstill unverified."
    },
    {
      "start": 388.683,
      "end": 389.251,
      "text": "Third."
    },
    {
      "start": 389.271,
      "end": 393.64,
      "text": "Production settings accepted a plain HTTP\nembedding endpoint."
    },
    {
      "start": 393.88,
      "end": 397.163,
      "text": "No transport rule covered provider\naddresses,"
    },
    {
      "start": 397.183,
      "end": 400.112,
      "text": "so keys and documents could travel\nunencrypted."
    },
    {
      "start": 400.352,
      "end": 405.297,
      "text": "Providers now require HTTPS with\ncertificate verification,"
    },
    {
      "start": 405.317,
      "end": 408.609,
      "text": "refuse redirects, and ignore environment\nproxies."
    },
    {
      "start": 408.849,
      "end": 412.18,
      "text": "One hundred and fifty-nine new transport\ntests pass."
    },
    {
      "start": 412.42,
      "end": 415.531,
      "text": "No real external provider has been\nexercised."
    },
    {
      "start": 416.483,
      "end": 417.1,
      "text": "Fourth."
    },
    {
      "start": 417.12,
      "end": 420.682,
      "text": "A client could rewrite its own address and\navoid rate limits."
    },
    {
      "start": 420.922,
      "end": 424.07,
      "text": "The server trusted forwarding headers from\nevery peer."
    },
    {
      "start": 424.31,
      "end": 428.163,
      "text": "Now no proxy is trusted unless it is\nexplicitly listed."
    },
    {
      "start": 428.402,
      "end": 433.36,
      "text": "One hundred and ninety-seven unit cases\nand seventeen runtime checks pass."
    },
    {
      "start": 433.6,
      "end": 436.585,
      "text": "The real production ingress remains\nunverified."
    },
    {
      "start": 437.567,
      "end": 438.172,
      "text": "Fifth."
    },
    {
      "start": 438.192,
      "end": 440.372,
      "text": "A hostile document could tie up a worker."
    },
    {
      "start": 440.612,
      "end": 444.167,
      "text": "Parsing ran inside the long-lived worker,\nwith no limits."
    },
    {
      "start": 444.407,
      "end": 448.936,
      "text": "Each parse now runs in a fresh process\nwith limits on time, processor,"
    },
    {
      "start": 448.956,
      "end": 450.275,
      "text": "memory and output."
    },
    {
      "start": 450.515,
      "end": 454.818,
      "text": "One hundred new tests pass, including\nkilled and restarted workers."
    },
    {
      "start": 455.058,
      "end": 458.391,
      "text": "This is containment, not a complete\nsecurity sandbox."
    },
    {
      "start": 459.367,
      "end": 460.034,
      "text": "Sixth."
    },
    {
      "start": 460.054,
      "end": 463.546,
      "text": "A superseded job could resume and publish\nover newer work."
    },
    {
      "start": 463.786,
      "end": 466.354,
      "text": "A claim did not say which attempt owned\nthe job."
    },
    {
      "start": 466.594,
      "end": 470.955,
      "text": "Every claim now carries an attempt number,\nand stale attempts change nothing."
    },
    {
      "start": 471.195,
      "end": 475.907,
      "text": "Killed workers recovered in about thirty\nseconds, using shortened test intervals."
    },
    {
      "start": 476.147,
      "end": 479.907,
      "text": "With default settings, recovery can take\nabout seventeen minutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 480.9,
      "end": 483.371,
      "text": "Seventh, found while fixing that one."
    },
    {
      "start": 483.391,
      "end": 486.282,
      "text": "A stale crawl could overwrite newer stored\npages."
    },
    {
      "start": 486.522,
      "end": 488.582,
      "text": "Each page had one fixed storage key."
    },
    {
      "start": 488.822,
      "end": 490.814,
      "text": "Every write now gets a new key,"
    },
    {
      "start": 490.834,
      "end": 494.277,
      "text": "published only by the attempt that still\nowns the job."
    },
    {
      "start": 494.297,
      "end": 496.346,
      "text": "Unused uploads are reclaimed."
    },
    {
      "start": 496.586,
      "end": 499.794,
      "text": "Thirteen of twenty new tests failed before\nthe fix."
    },
    {
      "start": 499.814,
      "end": 501.163,
      "text": "All twenty pass now."
    },
    {
      "start": 501.403,
      "end": 504.075,
      "text": "It was tested on local object storage\nonly."
    },
    {
      "start": 505.067,
      "end": 505.723,
      "text": "Eighth."
    },
    {
      "start": 505.743,
      "end": 510.807,
      "text": "The inbox silently dropped older messages,\nand a bad cursor returned page one."
    },
    {
      "start": 511.047,
      "end": 515.478,
      "text": "Cursors were unchecked, and screen state\nsurvived an organization switch."
    },
    {
      "start": 515.718,
      "end": 520.509,
      "text": "Cursors are now scoped and validated,\nolder messages load on request,"
    },
    {
      "start": 520.529,
      "end": 522.219,
      "text": "and screens reset safely."
    },
    {
      "start": 522.459,
      "end": 524.569,
      "text": "Twenty-six new backend tests pass."
    },
    {
      "start": 524.809,
      "end": 526.885,
      "text": "Pages are not a snapshot:"
    },
    {
      "start": 526.905,
      "end": 529.863,
      "text": "a busy conversation can be missed until\nrefresh."
    },
    {
      "start": 530.933,
      "end": 531.8,
      "text": "Ninth."
    },
    {
      "start": 531.82,
      "end": 535.612,
      "text": "Installing the widget twice broke it,\nnothing could remove it,"
    },
    {
      "start": 535.632,
      "end": 538.245,
      "text": "and visitors could see internal usage\nfields."
    },
    {
      "start": 538.485,
      "end": 542.975,
      "text": "There was no instance registry, and the\ndashboard response shape was reused."
    },
    {
      "start": 543.215,
      "end": 548.455,
      "text": "A registry now keeps one instance, destroy\ncleans up, conversations resume,"
    },
    {
      "start": 548.475,
      "end": 550.762,
      "text": "and public responses are allow-listed."
    },
    {
      "start": 551.002,
      "end": 555.639,
      "text": "The compressed loader is five thousand two\nhundred and forty-eight bytes,"
    },
    {
      "start": 555.659,
      "end": 558.678,
      "text": "against a budget of ten thousand two\nhundred and forty."
    },
    {
      "start": 558.918,
      "end": 560.647,
      "text": "It was tested in Chrome only."
    },
    {
      "start": 561.633,
      "end": 562.187,
      "text": "Tenth."
    },
    {
      "start": 562.207,
      "end": 564.77,
      "text": "Recovery shared the busy ingestion\nworkers."
    },
    {
      "start": 565.01,
      "end": 568.548,
      "text": "And a healthy scheduler only meant that a\nprocess was running."
    },
    {
      "start": 568.788,
      "end": 573.957,
      "text": "Recovery now has its own queue and worker,\nand health means tasks are being accepted."
    },
    {
      "start": 574.197,
      "end": 579.007,
      "text": "With every ingestion slot busy, recovery\nstill ran in under two seconds,"
    },
    {
      "start": 579.027,
      "end": 580.082,
      "text": "at a test interval."
    },
    {
      "start": 580.322,
      "end": 583.363,
      "text": "One earlier scheduler crash remains\nunexplained."
    },
    {
      "start": 584.367,
      "end": 585.16,
      "text": "Eleventh."
    },
    {
      "start": 585.18,
      "end": 587.835,
      "text": "A backup only counts once it has been\nrestored."
    },
    {
      "start": 588.075,
      "end": 592.211,
      "text": "The rehearsal found the restored database\nhad regained delete rights."
    },
    {
      "start": 592.451,
      "end": 597.027,
      "text": "That is fixed, and restore compares data\nfingerprints, counts and permissions."
    },
    {
      "start": 597.267,
      "end": 598.919,
      "text": "The local rehearsal passed."
    },
    {
      "start": 599.159,
      "end": 604.015,
      "text": "Off-site copies, alerting and production-\nscale recovery are not validated."
    },
    {
      "start": 606.35,
      "end": 608.322,
      "text": "The method was audit driven:"
    },
    {
      "start": 608.342,
      "end": 612.897,
      "text": "build, measure a baseline, record\nfindings, and fix one at a time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 612.917,
      "end": 615.186,
      "text": "with a failing test first where possible."
    },
    {
      "start": 615.426,
      "end": 619.966,
      "text": "Seven findings were remediated, with\nstabilization checkpoints between them."
    },
    {
      "start": 620.95,
      "end": 624.749,
      "text": "The first audit passed five hundred and\neighty-two backend tests,"
    },
    {
      "start": 624.769,
      "end": 626.736,
      "text": "yet its added checks failed."
    },
    {
      "start": 626.756,
      "end": 629.027,
      "text": "All seven findings now pass locally."
    },
    {
      "start": 632.3,
      "end": 636.224,
      "text": "The listed suites report twelve hundred\nand nine backend tests,"
    },
    {
      "start": 636.244,
      "end": 641.936,
      "text": "seventeen proxy tests run separately, two\nhundred and sixty-two frontend unit tests,"
    },
    {
      "start": 641.956,
      "end": 644.349,
      "text": "and seventeen browser journeys:"
    },
    {
      "start": 644.369,
      "end": 645.909,
      "text": "fifteen hundred and five."
    },
    {
      "start": 646.85,
      "end": 648.76,
      "text": "The path was not clean."
    },
    {
      "start": 648.78,
      "end": 651.822,
      "text": "Earlier checkpoints kept failing tests on\nrecord,"
    },
    {
      "start": 651.842,
      "end": 654.323,
      "text": "and a latency gate was missed before it\nheld."
    },
    {
      "start": 655.021,
      "end": 659.642,
      "text": "To check the tests themselves, fixes were\ndeliberately broken ten times,"
    },
    {
      "start": 659.662,
      "end": 661.102,
      "text": "and each break was caught."
    },
    {
      "start": 662.05,
      "end": 665.945,
      "text": "At one hundred concurrent chats, sixty-\nseven succeeded."
    },
    {
      "start": 665.965,
      "end": 670.457,
      "text": "Thirty-three received a controlled\nrejection, which is not an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 670.477,
      "end": 672.895,
      "text": "None failed unexpectedly."
    },
    {
      "start": 672.915,
      "end": 678.195,
      "text": "Successful responses had a P95 of about\nsixteen hundred and eighty-two"
    },
    {
      "start": 678.215,
      "end": 679.119,
      "text": "milliseconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 679.4,
      "end": 682.161,
      "text": "The gate passed ten of ten declared runs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 682.181,
      "end": 685.524,
      "text": "once with only twenty-five milliseconds to\nspare."
    },
    {
      "start": 685.544,
      "end": 688.572,
      "text": "This is not real model or server\nperformance."
    },
    {
      "start": 689.517,
      "end": 694.793,
      "text": "The self-audit score moved from eighty and\na half to eighty-five point seven five."
    },
    {
      "start": 694.813,
      "end": 696.993,
      "text": "It is not independent certification."
    },
    {
      "start": 697.233,
      "end": 700.5,
      "text": "Hosted CI is configured, but has not been\nrun."
    },
    {
      "start": 703.05,
      "end": 708.276,
      "text": "This undergraduate portfolio project was\ndeveloped with AI coding assistants,"
    },
    {
      "start": 708.296,
      "end": 710.438,
      "text": "including Codex and Claude Code."
    },
    {
      "start": 710.678,
      "end": 713.954,
      "text": "Its development process used written\nrequirements,"
    },
    {
      "start": 713.974,
      "end": 717.692,
      "text": "explicit acceptance criteria, baseline\nmeasurements,"
    },
    {
      "start": 717.712,
      "end": 720.918,
      "text": "focused remediation and documented\nvalidation."
    },
    {
      "start": 721.158,
      "end": 725.401,
      "text": "Failures were kept on record, and\ndecisions needing approval were held,"
    },
    {
      "start": 725.421,
      "end": 726.38,
      "text": "not assumed."
    },
    {
      "start": 728.95,
      "end": 730.118,
      "text": "Where it stands:"
    },
    {
      "start": 730.138,
      "end": 735.43,
      "text": "the core engineering is validated locally,\nand all seven audit findings pass."
    },
    {
      "start": 735.45,
      "end": 738.68,
      "text": "A migration recovery policy still awaits\napproval."
    },
    {
      "start": 738.92,
      "end": 741.064,
      "text": "Real AI evaluation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 741.084,
      "end": 745.426,
      "text": "semantic retrieval quality and answer\ncorrectness are untested."
    },
    {
      "start": 745.446,
      "end": 749.076,
      "text": "Hosted CI and production deployment remain\nopen."
    },
    {
      "start": 749.096,
      "end": 751.101,
      "text": "The parser is not sandboxed,"
    },
    {
      "start": 751.121,
      "end": 754.614,
      "text": "and production backup and monitoring are\nunfinished."
    },
    {
      "start": 754.634,
      "end": 756.777,
      "text": "These are requirements still to meet."
    },
    {
      "start": 757.717,
      "end": 762.558,
      "text": "A multi-tenant AI customer support\nplatform with retrieval augmented"
    },
    {
      "start": 762.577,
      "end": 763.389,
      "text": "generation."
    },
    {
      "start": 763.629,
      "end": 765.853,
      "text": "Its value is in the engineering:"
    },
    {
      "start": 765.873,
      "end": 769.553,
      "text": "isolation, failure handling and evidence\nyou can check."
    },
    {
      "start": 769.865,
      "end": 771.261,
      "text": "Thank you for watching."
    },
    {
      "start": 771.281,
      "end": 773.312,
      "text": "The portfolio address is on screen."
    }
  ]
}
